+### Staging API TLS
+
+Outbound requests to `STAGING_API_URL` can be configured to accept a self-signed certificate with `STAGING_API_ALLOW_SELF_SIGNED=true`.
+Set it to `false` if the staging endpoint uses a certificate signed by a trusted CA.
